Id":110320301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":214201,"speakerName":"Baishi","textMapHash":783046314,"text":"Ahhhh...","nextNodeIds":[110320302]},{"nodeId":110320302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":214301,"speakerName":"Baiwen","textMapHash":3578825306,"text":"Baishi, are you okay? Did you fall asleep standing up?","nextNodeIds":[110320303]},{"nodeId":110320303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":214001,"speakerName":"Baixiao","textMapHash":185453418,"text":"Look... Look who's back!","nextNodeIds":[110320304]},{"nodeId":110320304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1015,"speakerName":"Ganyu","textMapHash":3900856434,"text":"You even have enough time for leisure? It seems you three are a suitable replacement for me after all.","nextNodeIds":[110320305]},{"nodeId":110320305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":214301,"speakerName":"Baiwen","textMapHash":1195216234,"text":"Not at all! We just... We've been working for too long. If we didn't take a break...","nextNodeIds":[110320306]},{"nodeId":110320306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":214001,"speakerName":"Baixiao","textMapHash":1750449954,"text":"We wouldn't have survived long enough to see you again, Ms. Ganyu.","nextNodeIds":[110320307]},{"nodeId":110320307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":214201,"speakerName":"Baishi","textMapHash":493737602,"text":"Ms. Ganyu, we've missed you...","nextNodeIds":[110320308]},{"nodeId":110320308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1015,"speakerName":"Ganyu","textMapHash":4016683786,"text":"Ehehe. That's so kind of you all, given we've only met once.","nextNodeIds":[110320309]},{"nodeId":110320309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":214301,"speakerName":"Baiwen","textMapHash":3304033018,"text":"We've been praying day and night for you to return and take over your duties again.","nextNodeIds":[110320310]},{"nodeId":110320310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":214201,"speakerName":"Baishi","textMapHash":3855694570,"text":"To us, you're like an adeptus coming down to the human world to save all life.","nextNodeIds":[110320311]},{"nodeId":110320311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":214001,"speakerName":"Baixiao","textMapHash":888651002,"text":"Forget all our envious complaints from before — just free us from this strenuous work, please...","nextNodeIds":[110320312]},{"nodeId":110320312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1015,"speakerName":"Ganyu","textMapHash":117919242,"text":"Alright, alright, I see.","nextNodeIds":[110320313]},{"nodeId":110320313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1015,"speakerName":"Ganyu","textMapHash":2403807330,"text":"Please divide the matters at hand into government affairs, business affairs, and civil affairs. Mark out the tasks that haven't been started and those that are in progress...","nextNodeIds":[110320314]},{"nodeId":110320314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1015,"speakerName":"Ganyu","textMapHash":2466504690,"text":"I'll take care of the rest.","nextNodeIds":[110320315]},{"nodeId":110320315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":214301,"speakerName":"Baiwen","textMapHash":3645204138,"text":"Of course! We'll do it right away!","nextNodeIds":[110320316]},{"nodeId":110320316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":214201,"speakerName":"Baishi","textMapHash":1558011770,"text":"Finally... We're saved...","nextNodeIds":[110320317]},{"nodeId":110320317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1015,"speakerName":"Ganyu","textMapHash":770689210,"text":"Ah, yes, there's one more thing.","nextNodeIds":[110320318]},{"nodeId":110320318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1015,"speakerName":"Ganyu","textMapHash":500579258,"text":"I'd like to earnestly thank you, Traveler. If it weren't for your companionship, I would still be embroiled in my inner conflict right now.","nextNodeIds":[110320319,110320320]},{"nodeId":110320319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3162957466,"text":"It was a fun adventure for me, too.","nextNodeIds":[110320321]},{"nodeId":110320321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1015,"speakerName":"Ganyu","textMapHash":2997258938,"text":"Hehe, to think that I'd gain a human friend outside of work. It makes me happier than I could've imagined.","nextNodeIds":[110320322]},{"nodeId":110320322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1015,"speakerName":"Ganyu","textMapHash":397315106,"text":"I'd like to repay you when I'm done with the work at hand. What would you say if I... accompanied you on one of your trips?","nextNodeIds":[110320323]},{"nodeId":110320323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":737182570,"text":"Sure, but... are you ever done with work, Ganyu?","nextNodeIds":[110320324]},{"nodeId":110320324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1015,"speakerName":"Ganyu","textMapHash":3696195474,"text":"Hm...","nextNodeIds":[110320325]},{"nodeId":110320325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1015,"speakerName":"Ganyu","textMapHash":3608158962,"text":"Uh, let's cross that bridge when we come to it, shall we...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":110320320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2713108874,"text":"It's good that you've pulled yourself together.","nextNodeIds":[110320321]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1103203,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["20015","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133107154,1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["214001"],"NOCCOBOF